            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11'>The purpose of this Dashboard is to monitor Weightable metric and Analyse its trend over time and factors driving the trend. It has following tabs: (</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='11' italic='true'>you can click on the button below to redirect on the dedicated view)</run>
